{"title":"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:00)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2cd1c2adc0a5a8775c1a15378c3a8ef825966ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{}_{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the smallest positive <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> that is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/1/6d18facbaafbaa9b830af02edf595d2cafb971d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75_{}^{}$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and has exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/1/6d18facbaafbaa9b830af02edf595d2cafb971d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75_{}^{}$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> positive integral divisors, including <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/217cdd65b4450a90a269b28288ed60b374669a49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1_{}^{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"12\" /> and itself. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/0/f7014d2e3753160137062db29e9329d435cf8ad8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime_factorization\" title=\"Prime factorization\">prime factorization</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa1e625f9761f3a4e48926ad50ae8a1e86aa392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75 = 3^15^2 = (2+1)(4+1)(4+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"265\" height=\"21\" />. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> to have exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> integral divisors, we need to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81d2312f88d9c7aa34fdb4d24e6ebec59b478078.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = p_1^{e_1-1}p_2^{e_2-1}\\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"19\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a0eac9d18598f91a2bb069808413b1864946240.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e_1e_2 \\cdots = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693d7f7f7a929e6163ee24f6d6b5b657424abed8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75|n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />, two of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prime\">prime</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factor\" title=\"Factor\">factors</a> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. To minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, we can introduce a third prime factor, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Also to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the greatest of all the factors, to be raised to the least power. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/e/fde94765cd614de16b45b9e823dbb0c06ffae430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2^43^45^2$\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/6013bab9c08d83ea9a69dc894b011dcf26268690.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n}{75} = \\frac{2^43^45^2}{3 \\cdot 5^2} = 16 \\cdot 27 = \\boxed{432}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"237\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/2/fd2fe17aa4c06349cce4f5b8906cbcdb84b70f2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{ Note: the smallest integer n which has 75 factors happens to be a multiple of 75 anyway  }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"757\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must have a prime factorization of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f46380dedeae972b3b12b396cd27c023638e3c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(z^2)(x^4)(k^4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"21\" /> since this will lead to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> having <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> factors. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/30270a94a37744dad65135425b6aee82c00e1e96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5^2)(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"21\" /> as a factor. To minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> we can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. We can let whichever the last variable is be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to minimize and when we divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> the results is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/e/5beddb3ee1ee72a38fba8e89d1ffda61969705fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3^3)(2^4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"21\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/7/377d4ea3974aef4b4432ffdf2a754928188318e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{432}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~jamespudi\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_.28Logical.2C_Good_Editing.2C_.7E1:00.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~1:00)\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~1:00)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/-izJsf4CBR4\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/-izJsf4CBR4</a>\n</p><p>~Ebai\n</p><p>Note: the problem where this is linked is covered 0:40-1:40\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jgyyGeEKhwk?t=588\">https://youtu.be/jgyyGeEKhwk?t=588</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zlFLzuotaMU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zlFLzuotaMU</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME\" title=\"1990 AIME\">1990 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1990 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017000732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 274/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6587/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.684      1 -total\n 56.75%    7.766      1 Template:AIME_box\n 41.66%    5.700      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2873:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017000732 and revision id 291681. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}